  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Block does not move upto a maximum applied force of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></math>down the inclined plane.</p><p>Equation of motion is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>F</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ....(i)</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/f5d653c4-fa70-46ad-9f2c-5a15aaa73b5d-image.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 181px;\" /></p><p>Similarly, block also does not move upto a maximum applied force of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>12</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math> up the plane.</p><p>Now, equation of motion is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></math></p><p>or, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></math>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;...(ii)</p><p>Solving Eqs. (i) and (ii), we have</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>15</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Hence, dividing</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>&#956;</mi></mfrac><mi>tan</mi><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>15</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
